35,2,1,talk,Minako,,"The timing shows a full pass is over two hours, not the half hour we assume.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, that aligns with the chat logs. The friction starts when the absent return.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"@All, I found the grout fails in eleven days. ""Done"" is just whoever left last.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"@All, the receipts show we buy the same spray twice a month. The previous note warns against permanent splits.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Servas,,"@All, the firm requires a two-hour window and a tidy space. The stock shows we waste money on duplicates.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Servas, if the firm needs two hours, that is a significant block of my day.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, it is less than the two hours we currently lose to arguments and re-cleaning.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Benjamin, but if the standard is ""whoever left last,"" the firm will just clean what we leave.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Sakura, true. But if we pay a flat fee, the cost is fixed and transparent.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@All, the cost is fixed, but the social cost of a rigid schedule might be higher.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Minako,,I need to know if the firm's time overlaps with my training.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, we can schedule it for a time when the two absent housemates are usually home.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Benjamin, that still leaves the days in between where the grout turns black again.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Sakura, perhaps a small weekly task list for the in-between days would help.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Servas,,"@Shizue, a small shared task is better than a large individual burden. It keeps us connected.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
