60,3,1,talk,Minako,,Option B removes the two-hour block from my week entirely. That is the most efficient use of my time.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, but it does not address the usage imbalance. The absent housemates pay the same as the present ones.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Sakura,,"@Benjamin, Option A is the only one that forces a consistent standard. If I am on duty, I know exactly what to do.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"@Sakura, Option B is the only one where the cost is a single, clear number. No more guessing who bought the spray.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Servas,,"@All, I worry that Option C will create permanent silos. We will stop talking about the house and start talking about ""my"" room.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Minako,,"@Servas, I agree. Option C is too rigid. I need flexibility, not a permanent job description.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, Option B is flexible, but it is expensive. Are we willing to pay for convenience?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Benjamin, I am willing to pay for consistency. If the grout is clean every week, I can stop bracing myself.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Sakura, the cost is about 15,000 yen a month. It is a lot, but it is predictable.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Servas,,"@All, the question is not just money. It is whether we can trust each other to keep the peace.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Minako,,"@Servas, I trust the system more than I trust the current habit. Option B is the most reliable.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,"@Minako, I am leaning toward Option B, but I want to ensure the invoice is split fairly based on presence.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Benjamin, if we split it fairly, I am in. I just need the standard to be clear.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Shizue,,"@All, I am in for Option B. The transparency of the invoice is what I need.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Servas,,"@All, I am in for Option B. It removes the daily friction and lets us focus on being housemates, not managers.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
